1
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,800
Everything will be fine

2
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:44,800
Hold on to me, Your Highness!

3
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,200
Everything will be fine

4
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:30,600
Wei Delu, wake up!

5
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,800
Where are we?

6
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,400
Are you all right?

7
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:01,400
-I'm fine...
-Give me a hand

8
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:18,200
Where on earth are we?

9
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:21,400
No idea. I was counting on you
to tell me

10
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,600
Up

11
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:28,800
Let's move.
Be careful

12
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,400
Are you all right?

13
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:47,200
I'm sorry.
Are you all right?

14
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:50,200
Are you all right?

15
00:03:58,200 --> 00:04:00,600
Here, sit down

16
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:36,200
Outrageous!
You're a brazen lot

17
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:39,400
The gall of you to conspire with
Wei Delu to abduct Princess Ruining

18
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:42,600
Men! Haul them outside and give them
50 strokes of the paddle!

19
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:46,400
I'm innocent, Your Excellency...!

20
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,400
Shut up!

21
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,800
Stop shouting or I'll give you
a few tight slaps!

22
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:53,400
The key to officialdom is lending
a listening ear to the commoners

23
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:57,800
A good official allows the commoners
to voice their grievances

24
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:02,800
That's right! There is
no proof of our wrongdoing

25
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:06,800
How dare you claim
I have no proof against you!

26
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:13,400
The guards saw the five of you, masked
and clad in black, stealthily...

27
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:18,000
brought a huge kite to meet Wei Delu
at Baiyun Ridge in the dead of night...

28
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,800
before abducting Princess Ruining

29
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:22,400
Your Excellency,
the statement is erroneous

30
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,800
How so?

31
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:31,400
Your Excellency mentioned
five masked persons clad in black

32
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:35,400
It was a dark and windy night
where one couldn't see properly

33
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:38,200
So how did Your Excellency
establish our identities?

34
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:41,000
Don't malign your people,
Your Excellency

35
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:45,200
Or she'll lodge a complaint
against you in the Capital!

36
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:48,800
Since you weren't the culprits,
surely someone else was?

37
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,800
Your Excellency, allow me
to answer that question

38
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:56,200
That person is of a high birth.
She's none other the Princess

39
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:59,200
Ever since my son
made her acquaintance,

40
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:02,200
he'd seen lesser of the other people

41
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:07,200
Your Excellency,
on that dark and windy night,

42
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:11,200
I was distributing herbs in
the streets with Wu Fuqi and the rest

43
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:13,400
Your Excellency even tried
to shoo us away

44
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:19,000
I still recall what Your Excellency
said and did that night vividly

45
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:23,400
Finally, we heeded Your Excellency's
order and headed home to rest in bed

46
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,400
Remember?

47
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:30,160
Your Excellency should live up to
your name as an upright official

48
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,200
Exactly

49
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:34,400
They were seen in the streets and...

50
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:37,400
believed to have abducted
the Princess on a ridge only if...

51
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,800
Only if what?

52
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:41,200
Only if we were deities

53
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:44,400
Unless we knew the art of
making ourselves invisible

54
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,200
But we know none of that

55
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:51,000
Well said, Mei Shouquan!
Since you weren't the culprits,

56
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,800
your accomplices were behind it then!

57
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:57,600
How could Your Excellency say that?
You need to show us evidence

58
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,800
You catch a pair of adulterers in bed

59
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:04,400
Correct! How could you arrest us
based on speculation?

60
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:11,800
Wu Fuqi, Mei Shouquan, since you
claim you had alibis for that night,

61
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:15,400
I shall show you mercy and
drop the case against you

62
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:19,000
But I am certain your accomplices...

63
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:21,400
I'm innocent, Your Excellency!

64
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:25,200
I remember having a fight
with my neighbour, Madam Ma,

65
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:27,800
on the street
on that dark and windy night

66
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,800
A crowd even gathered to watch us

67
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:33,800
Exactly! Your Excellency could
question all the neighbours

68
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,600
They'll tell you how often
my mother quarrels with others

69
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:44,800
When I saw how angry Shi Yaoqian
looked, I almost burst into laughter

70
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:50,200
-He's probably still fuming away
-That doesn't worry us

71
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:55,000
Let him die from anger and the people
of Ping'an Town will see good days

72
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,000
That's right!

73
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,400
Shi Yaoqian is an evil,
corrupt official

74
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:01,800
I don't fear him.
What can he do about me?

75
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,600
Fu, Lu's plan was brilliant

76
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:07,400
It allowed him to leave
without getting us into trouble

77
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:10,400
-It kills two birds with one stone
-No, it's three birds

78
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:13,800
-Three birds?
-We got that fat man hopping mad!

79
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,800
I see all of you are here

80
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:28,200
Are you the plaintiffs or
the defendants?

81
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:33,800
One doesn't necessarily come to
the yamen over some dispute, right?

82
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,400
So you're here to look in on a trial?

83
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:42,600
I'm not here to sue anyone
or defend myself

84
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,800
We're here on a business trip

85
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,800
Right here?
You can't be serious

86
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,400
Let's go!

87
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:53,400
Surely not?
This is totally absurd

88
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:58,200
Not really. Thanks to the epidemic,
people are staying indoors

89
00:08:58,400 --> 00:09:01,200
How does that concern you?
You're going home!

90
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:04,000
Jiujin...

91
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,200
Jiujin, get up and take your medicine

92
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:09,400
No, Uncle.
I don't want

93
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:12,400
Be a good girl, Jiujin

94
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:15,600
I don't want to have the medicine.
It's too bitter

95
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:18,800
Jiujin is not being a good girl.
You take medicine when you're unwell

96
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:23,000
Uncle often told you
bitter medicine does good to one

97
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,200
Be good.
Take the medicine

98
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:28,800
Uncle has taken medicine for years,
but you still don't get well

99
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:32,800
That's because I don't take
my medicine all the time

100
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:37,200
Be a dear, Jiujin. This medicine
will make you well again

101
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,400
Why isn't Sister Ma here to see me?

102
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:45,400
She's very busy. But she's promised
to visit you once you get well

103
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:48,800
I want Sister Ma to bring me
a rabbit figurine

104
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:50,200
No problem

105
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:54,400
If you take the medicine, I'll ask
Sister Ma to bring you 10 figurines

106
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,600
-All right?
-Really?

107
00:09:56,600 --> 00:10:00,600
Of course. But you have
to take the medicine first

108
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:03,600
-All right
-That's my girl

109
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:12,400
Shou, did Jiujin take her medicine?

110
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:15,800
-She had only half a bowl
-Is she any better?

111
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,400
No

112
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:21,000
Why isn't she getting better?

113
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:28,000
She'll be fine. My dear brother,
you grew up on medicine

114
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,800
But you're still as sickly

115
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:35,800
Jiujin probably hung out with you
too much and absorbed your bad karma

116
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:38,200
That's why she's so ill now

117
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:42,400
Sis, I don't mind if you attack me.
But Jiujin is your daughter

118
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:44,200
Can't you be nicer to her?

119
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:49,800
This epidemic has taken many lives

120
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:54,400
Just this month's sales of coffins
have surpassed last year's figures

121
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:58,400
That's music to my ears

122
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:02,400
-The roast chickens are here
-I've waited half a day for it!

123
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:09,400
The roast chicken smells great.
Mother, have it while it's hot

124
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:11,400
I bought the chickens at a steal

125
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:15,200
They used to cost one wen
for half a rooster

126
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:17,800
Now, they only cost one wen
for three roosters!

127
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:20,800
Mother, I hear the epidemic
in Yangshu Town...

128
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:24,800
is believed to have first
started among the chickens

129
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:28,800
That's why the people
slaughtered all the chickens

130
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,800
Wonder if these chickens
are from there

131
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:38,400
Don't scare me, Brother

132
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:42,800
Are you saying these chickens
are from Yangshu Town?

133
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:46,200
Why else are they so cheap?
One wen for three chickens

134
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:48,800
One wen can't even buy you
three eggs!

135
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:53,000
Also, we don't rear this breed
of chickens in Ping'an

136
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:56,600
I dare say these chickens are
carriers of the virus!

137
00:11:56,600 --> 00:12:00,800
This won't do.
Get someone to throw them away

138
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:04,200
Oh no. Has the epidemic
spread to Ping'an Town?

139
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:29,520
What are we going to live on
from now on?

140
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:34,200
Easy, easy. Do you have to bully
these defenceless women?

141
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:39,800
Fu, glad to see you! Isn't your
good friend, Lu, an official?

142
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:43,200
Ask him not to seal our shop off

143
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:47,200
It is our livelihood

144
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:52,200
Officials are bullies. Why the sudden
decision to seal the shop off?

145
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:55,800
You just do whatever you like.
Big deal, huh?

146
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:59,200
Magistrate Shi is ill.
He suspects he got it from Lili

147
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,400
-That's nonsense!
-Lili?!

148
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:07,400
Lili, you came back to the brothel
one month after you left

149
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:09,800
How did your husband die?

150
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:14,800
He... he probably contracted
the disease

151
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:19,400
So he really died from the epidemic!
You've landed us in trouble!

152
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:21,800
Everyone here has to be quarantined

153
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:26,800
-We'll be quarantined?!
-But we need to make a living!

154
00:13:26,800 --> 00:13:31,200
-Move it!
-I dare you to come near me!

155
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:35,000
-We'll all perish together!
-Enough of your nonsense!

156
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,600
Move it!

157
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:39,200
Stop pulling me

158
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:52,800
-Are you all right?
-Don't touch me

159
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:56,800
This little bird is trying to fly.
It's rolling on the floor

160
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:59,800
Stop fooling around.
Fengyue Court is in trouble!

161
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,400
What happened?

162
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:04,800
Guess whom Lili has spread
the disease

163
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:07,400
Who did Lili spread the disease to?

164
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:09,800
Shi Yaoqian!

165
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:14,400
Serves the philanderer right!

166
00:14:14,400 --> 00:14:18,400
Fengyue Court has been sealed
and Lili, arrested

167
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:21,800
This is bad news

168
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:26,400
I'm not worried about Shi Yaoqian
contracting the disease

169
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:30,800
I'm worried that the epidemic
has spread to Ping'an Town

170
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:35,400
My exact sentiments! Why else
was Fengyue Court sealed off?

171
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:37,800
Everyone from the brothel
has been isolated

172
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:41,800
Oh no! Jiujin may have
contracted the disease!

173
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:43,920
Come on. Stop scaring yourself

174
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:49,000
Jiujin has been ill for days and
the medicine does nothing for her

175
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:52,800
Worried, I sought
Gold Teeth's advice last night

176
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,400
-Do you know what he told me?
-What did he say?

177
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:57,200
He hid his face behind a mask!

178
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,800
That doesn't mean Jiujin
has contracted the disease

179
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,800
The symptoms are similar.
Jiujin has been delirious

180
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:06,200
She kept asking for Sister Ma
but the latter is nowhere to be found

181
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:08,200
I don't know how to comfort her

182
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:11,400
Even if Miss Ma were around,
she wouldn't be able to help

183
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:16,800
Jiujin is hoping Sister Ma
will get her a rabbit figurine

184
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,200
But I don't know where to get one

185
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:22,400
If Sister Ma were around, it'd offer
her a glimmer of hope, understand?

186
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:28,800
Fret not. I'll seek out Gold Teeth
and give him a good thrashing!

187
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:32,200
He shall give Jiujin treatment.
So stop worrying

188
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:34,400
Just make sure you don't kill him

189
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:41,200
Seeing how ill Jiujin is
just breaks my heart

190
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:44,800
Don't be too upset.
Go find Shuangxi

191
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,400
Why should I do that?

192
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,200
Doesn't Jiujin hope to see Miss Ma?

193
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:51,800
Shuangxi did a great job in
impersonating Golden Swallow

194
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:55,400
She'll pose as the latter again and
visit Jiujin with a rabbit figurine

195
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:59,800
Deal! I'll look up Shuangxi and
you'll go to Gold Teeth

196
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:05,800
A red-letter day for the physician
who shall not make home visits

197
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:11,200
Darn it! Lives are at stake and
here you are holing up at home!

198
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:18,200
Gold Teeth! You're coming with me
to save a life!

199
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:21,000
I can't even save myself now

200
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:24,200
But you were still fine yesterday

201
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:28,800
But I'm in constant contact with
patients. I'm not made of steel

202
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:30,800
It's inevitable that I got infected

203
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:35,400
It's an infectious disease. You'll
only spread it to more people!

204
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:37,800
You're coming to
the quarantine camp with me!

205
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:42,200
No! I am a physician after all

206
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:47,200
If people find out about it,
I'll lose face

207
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:50,800
This isn't the time for that!
Are you coming or not?

208
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:53,400
-No!
-What's going on?

209
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,400
Ask him!

210
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:56,800
He insists on sending me
to the quarantine camp

211
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:59,200
Fu, what's going on?

212
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:02,800
The yamen has ordered that all
infected persons are to be sent...

213
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:04,200
to the quarantine camp

214
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:08,200
Gold Teeth, how did you
contract the disease?!

215
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:13,200
I'd rather be your slave for life
than be sent to the camp!

216
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:18,800
Fu, you must not send Gold Teeth
to the quarantine camp

217
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:22,400
If you do that, no one will patronize
my medical shop again

218
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:27,200
Old Master Wei, you don't trifle
with an epidemic!

219
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:32,000
On account of your friendship
with Lu, let us off

220
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:36,800
I'll give your mother and you
a discount at our shop in future

221
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:42,200
As if I'd go for such bargains

222
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:47,400
Tell you what. Your family will get
one year's free supply of herbal tea

223
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:48,800
Will that do?

224
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:52,800
Fu, please do me this favour

225
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:06,000
Attention!
Attention, everyone!

226
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:13,200
Gold Teeth, the resident physician of
the Weis', is down with the disease

227
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:18,400
But we've since sent him
to the quarantine camp

228
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,800
It's a small matter.
Don't panic!

229
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:24,200
Don't panic

230
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:30,800
Wu Fuqi, I told you to keep it
hush-hush. So why are you doing this?

231
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:36,800
Listen up. The medical shop
will be closed for ten days

232
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:38,600
Ten days?!

233
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:42,800
The entire shop will be
disinfected with limewash

234
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:46,200
It's not the case!
Don't go away

235
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:50,400
Don't go away. I have another
important announcement to make

236
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:54,800
In order to prevent the epidemic
from spreading further in this town,

237
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:59,400
anyone who'd been in contact with
Gold Teeth should stay indoors

238
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:03,200
We want to contain the disease
in this town

239
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:11,800
Wu Fuqi, any idea how much losses
I'll incur for the next 10 days?

240
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:18,400
Old Master Wei, won't it be worse
if the yamen seals your shop instead?

241
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:22,200
You, you... My son entrusted me
to your care before he left

242
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:24,400
Is this how you take care of me?

243
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:29,800
Old Master Wei, what am I to tell Lu
should you contract the disease?

244
00:19:30,800 --> 00:19:35,800
Am I the only one at risk?
Mei Shouquan and Jiujin are ill too!

245
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:37,520
Why aren't you taking care of them?

246
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:41,200
Jiujin? Shuangxi is...
Oh no!

247
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:50,400
Jiujin...

248
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:54,400
Wake up, Jiujin.
Sister Ma is here to see you

249
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,400
Jiujin

250
00:19:57,600 --> 00:19:59,800
Is that you, Sister Ma?

251
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:03,400
Yes, it's me

252
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:07,200
See what I've got for you

253
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:10,800
It's the rabbit figurine.
I want it

254
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:21,000
-Do you like it?
-Thank you, Sister Ma

255
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:27,200
Shuangxi!
Move away from her

256
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:30,400
-Come here
-What are you doing?

257
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:33,000
Jiujin has contracted the disease.
She's infectious

258
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:36,200
What are you talking about?
Are you being serious?

259
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:40,200
It's true! I saw it with my own eyes.
Even Gold Teeth is down

260
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:43,800
Wasn't he Jiujin's physician?
I suspect he's the primary carrier!

261
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:45,800
Oh no! Don't scare me

262
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:49,200
It's true! Jiujin has been feverish
and she's not getting any better

263
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:52,400
This is a grave matter.
You've got to do something about it

264
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:56,200
-What's going to happen to Jiujin?
-Let's get her quarantined

265
00:20:56,600 --> 00:21:01,200
You'd better take a bath and take
some medicine. Don't get infected

266
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:02,920
Run along!

267
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:09,400
Who's been sent to
the quarantine camp?

268
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:12,400
Sis, stay calm. Don't be shocked by
what I'm going to tell you

269
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:16,600
Gold Teeth contracted the disease
and he's probably infected Jiujin

270
00:21:16,600 --> 00:21:19,800
Jiujin? You heard it from Fu?

271
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:24,200
Come on, nothing good
ever comes out of his mouth!

272
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:27,400
I won't let you play
such a prank on my daughter

273
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:31,400
This is no prank! Shou, I shan't
try to explain myself to them

274
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:34,200
This matter brooks no delay!
I'll be going

275
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:37,200
-Would I play such a prank?
-Go home and take a bath

276
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:40,400
-Stay right there!
-Sis, hear me out

277
00:21:40,800 --> 00:21:43,400
Don't send me away.
I want to stay here

278
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:47,400
Mother, where are you?
Don't send me away

279
00:21:47,600 --> 00:21:50,400
-I'm coming
-Don't go over!

280
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:53,400
It's an infectious disease

281
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:56,200
-Uncle...
-But she looks fine to me

282
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:59,400
-Why can't I go to her?
-Break it up

283
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:07,200
Don't be afraid.
Uncle is with you

284
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:11,800
No, it can't be. How could she
possibly contract the disease?

285
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:13,600
Fu was uttering rubbish!

286
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:17,600
-That's right
-It's an infectious disease

287
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:23,400
You heartless creep!
She's our daughter

288
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:26,000
She's our flesh and blood!

289
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:30,200
Don't send me away.
Mother, where are you?

290
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:31,800
Break it up

291
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:38,600
My daughter... Do you want our family
to be hit by the epidemic?

292
00:22:39,800 --> 00:22:41,800
What shall we do?

293
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:47,000
Think of something, brother

294
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:51,800
The only option is to send Jiujin
to the quarantine camp

295
00:22:51,800 --> 00:22:53,400
Are you going or not?

296
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:58,400
Fine, I'll take her there

297
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,400
Go away!

298
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:07,400
Move it, heartless creep!

299
00:23:09,600 --> 00:23:13,000
-Uncle, where are we going?
-To the quarantine camp

300
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:17,800
You don't want me anymore?
Why are you taking me to the camp?

301
00:23:17,800 --> 00:23:20,400
Be a dear, Jiujin.
We're not abandoning you

302
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:22,400
But all sick persons
have to be at the camp

303
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:25,400
But I won't get to see you again

304
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:30,000
Rest assured I won't abandon you.
I'll bring you meat buns every day

305
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:33,200
-No!
-Is Jiujin being naughty?

306
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:35,400
I want candied malt as well

307
00:23:35,600 --> 00:23:38,520
Sure! Uncle will buy you
candied malt every day

308
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:57,800
-It's a troubling sight
-So many people are wailing away

309
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:01,400
Is the sky falling down on us?

310
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:05,800
By the way, the people have been
praying to the God of Plague

311
00:24:05,800 --> 00:24:09,800
What's the use of
praying to a wicked deity?

312
00:24:09,800 --> 00:24:13,800
Says who!
Look at what's become of our masters

313
00:24:13,800 --> 00:24:17,000
The people are pleading with
God of Plague to let them off

314
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:19,800
At the end of the day,
blame it on our useless masters

315
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:23,200
If only they could answer prayers.
Then you and I would have it good

316
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:25,800
-You're still hankering after that?
-Why not?

317
00:24:25,800 --> 00:24:29,200
Do you still remember how tiring
it was for us back then?

318
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:32,800
Now, don't you say anything else

319
00:24:32,800 --> 00:24:34,800
-You can't stop me
-I dare you to do that

320
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:35,800
I want it

321
00:24:35,800 --> 00:24:38,000
I can't be bothered with you!
This is so frustrating

322
00:24:39,800 --> 00:24:42,200
The three stars are a finished bunch

323
00:24:42,200 --> 00:24:45,800
Trust two lowly spirits to stick
around in a run-down temple

324
00:24:45,800 --> 00:24:47,400
Who are you? Stop scaring us!

325
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:50,920
He's not a friend!
Let's get out of here!

326
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:11,400
-Where are we?
-The safest place for us

327
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:15,200
Really? Don't you have me on again

328
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:22,200
Would I have you on?
Why do you think I brought you here?

329
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:24,200
Somehow, I find this place weird

330
00:25:24,400 --> 00:25:25,800
Surely not?

331
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:48,200
You can forget about running away

332
00:25:48,600 --> 00:25:50,600
I'll leave you immobile

333
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:55,200
Please let us off.
If you do that,

334
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:58,200
we'll do your bidding

335
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:02,800
God of Plague, even if
you don't let us off,

336
00:26:02,800 --> 00:26:04,800
we'll still be at your command

337
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:10,400
I must say you two are smooth-talkers

338
00:26:11,200 --> 00:26:16,400
Fine, I'll put you in charge of all
the troubles and gossips in the world

339
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:23,600
You are to report to me every thing
you see and every word you hear

340
00:26:25,200 --> 00:26:28,800
Rest assured we'll report to you
everything we see

341
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:35,400
If we hide the truth from you,
we'll put ourselves at your mercy

342
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:39,600
If you dare defy my order,

343
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:42,800
I'll break your neck, understand?

344
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:47,800
Yes, yes. We'll submit to Master
and take orders from you

345
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:51,200
Listen good, the two of you

346
00:26:52,400 --> 00:26:55,800
The three stars have been relegated
to the mortal world

347
00:26:55,800 --> 00:27:00,800
But if they get reinstated,
their powers will return to them

348
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:07,800
They'll certainly ruin my plan
to rule heaven, earth and hell

349
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:12,400
You are to prevent the Trio
from doing good turns and earning merit

350
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:16,400
Don't let them get reinstated

351
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:20,200
Chaos will then rule the world

352
00:27:22,800 --> 00:27:25,400
Rest assured we'll do your bidding

353
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:09,800
-Miss Ma!
-Zhang Guolao?

354
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:14,800
What's happened to this place?

355
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:18,800
I was merely away for a while but
Ping-an Town has become a living hell

356
00:28:19,600 --> 00:28:21,800
Calamities strike one unawares

357
00:28:21,800 --> 00:28:24,800
An epidemic has turned
the place upside down

358
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:31,200
This is strange.
How did the epidemic come about?

359
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:35,200
Well, God of Plague is behind it

360
00:28:35,800 --> 00:28:38,800
Him again?
I'll go drive him away!

361
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:42,800
I'm doing this for the people,
not the Trio

362
00:28:42,800 --> 00:28:44,800
It's not an abuse of my powers,
is it?

363
00:28:44,800 --> 00:28:49,200
The Jade Emperor sent the Trio here
to undergo trials and tribulations

364
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:53,400
This epidemic is just the thing
the Trio need to help the people

365
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:57,200
If we don't seize this opportunity,
when will the next one come along?

366
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,800
You're saying?

367
00:28:58,800 --> 00:29:03,200
This is a chance for the Trio
to do good and accumulate merit

368
00:29:03,800 --> 00:29:06,800
In that case, I shan't get involved

369
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:15,200
Come on. The God of Longevity
holds the key to this crisis

370
00:29:15,200 --> 00:29:21,200
We have to awaken the heart of
compassion in Mei Shouquan

371
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:23,800
Use his strength to save the world

372
00:29:23,800 --> 00:29:26,800
He can't even save himself now,
let alone others

373
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:30,400
Once the time is right,
he'll be a changed man

374
00:29:30,600 --> 00:29:33,800
You'll go with him to Penglai Island
in Eastern Sea and...

375
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:35,400
look for a pill-cultivating furnace

376
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:39,200
Why should we do that?

377
00:29:39,400 --> 00:29:44,200
The furnace is a treasured relic
left behind by Goddess Nuwa

378
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:48,800
It's made with the best metals
from nine lands...

379
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:13,800
-What do you want?
-My niece, Jiujin, is inside

380
00:30:13,800 --> 00:30:15,400
I've brought some food for her

381
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:17,800
I'll bring it to her.
You may go now

382
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:21,800
I've been giving it to her
personally. Please let me in

383
00:30:21,800 --> 00:30:24,800
You can see for yourself
how bad the situation is

384
00:30:24,800 --> 00:30:28,800
Banning all visitations
is for your own good

385
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:32,800
Please let me see her.
I miss her very much

386
00:30:33,000 --> 00:30:35,800
Are you tired of living?
Go away!

387
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:41,200
Miss Ma, you're just the person!
They won't let me see Jiujin

388
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:43,800
I'm sure you have a way
to help me see her

389
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:47,800
What's the point, Shou?
Do you have a cure for her?

390
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:50,400
No, I don't.
You mean you do?

391
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:53,800
There is a cure for her.
But...

392
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:56,400
It depends on whether
you're willing to do it

393
00:30:56,600 --> 00:31:00,200
So long as Jiujin can be saved,
I don't mind losing my life

394
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:04,200
You don't have to die. But you've got
to make a trip to Eastern Sea with me

395
00:31:04,200 --> 00:31:07,800
Eastern Sea? Where is that?
Why should I go there with you?

396
00:31:07,800 --> 00:31:11,000
It's said Goddess Nuwa left behind
a pill-cultivating furnace...

397
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:13,000
on Penglai Island in Eastern Sea

398
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:14,800
What is this pill furnace?

399
00:31:14,800 --> 00:31:18,200
Made with the best metals
from nine lands,

400
00:31:18,200 --> 00:31:20,200
pills made in it
will cure all diseases!

401
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:23,400
That's amazing! So there is hope for
the people in Ping'an Town

402
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:25,800
-That's right
-I'll go with you

403
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:29,400
-Really? You'll do that?
-Yes, I will

404
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:33,200
Not only can I save the people in
Ping'an Town, I'll save Jiujin too

405
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:34,400
Let's go

406
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:43,800
Fu! Still eating?

407
00:31:43,800 --> 00:31:46,400
I'm so glad to see you.
Let's get going

408
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:50,800
Where are you going?
We've got lots of food. Join us

409
00:31:50,800 --> 00:31:53,600
It's more expensive to eat out

410
00:31:53,600 --> 00:31:55,800
You're still in the mood for a feast?

411
00:31:55,800 --> 00:31:59,200
An epidemic is raging on. We don't
want to do nothing and await death

412
00:31:59,800 --> 00:32:01,800
Epidemic doesn't necessarily kill!

413
00:32:02,600 --> 00:32:06,800
You sounded so confident! Do you have
a miracle pill for the people?

414
00:32:06,800 --> 00:32:13,600
Yes! Goddess Nuwa's pill-cultivating
furnace is still in Easter Sea

415
00:32:14,800 --> 00:32:17,200
Miss Ma, what has that
got to do with us?

416
00:32:17,200 --> 00:32:19,800
Can we cook food using the furnace?

417
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:24,200
Pill made in that furnace
can cure all diseases!

418
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:26,800
Really? Let's go find it

419
00:32:28,200 --> 00:32:31,200
Goddess Nuwa's pill-cultivating
furnace? I know that!

420
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:35,200
You do? How do you know about it?

421
00:32:35,200 --> 00:32:37,200
I know more than that

422
00:32:37,200 --> 00:32:41,200
The red belly-wrap which Queen Mother
wore on her wedding day...

423
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:43,200
is still at the peak of Mount Nan

424
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:45,400
The red belly-wrap is a treasure

425
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:50,400
Whoever wears it will be immune to
all disasters and diseases

426
00:32:51,400 --> 00:32:54,800
Is that so?
How come I didn't know about it?

427
00:32:55,800 --> 00:33:00,200
The red belly-wrap
has another amazing power

428
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:03,000
You don't get exposed for
telling lies

429
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:05,800
Will you be serious for once?

430
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:09,400
-What are you laughing at?
-Stop deceiving yourself and others

431
00:33:09,400 --> 00:33:13,800
I won't be taken in by
that tall tale of yours. Childish!

432
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:16,200
I don't believe you either

433
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:21,000
The pill-cultivating furnace exists!
Why doesn't anyone believe me?

434
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:23,200
Believe her.
I believe you, even if they don't

435
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:26,400
-You're a fool to believe her
-Why not?

436
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:30,200
This is a grave matter! We'd
rather err on the side of caution

437
00:33:30,400 --> 00:33:36,200
That's why we're here to ask you
to go to the Eastern Sea with us

438
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:41,000
-We'll have one another's company
-You want me to join you?

439
00:33:41,200 --> 00:33:43,800
Of course! We're helping you
to earn merit. Are you coming?

440
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:47,800
Earn merit? Pill-cultivating furnace?
How ridiculous! I'm not going!

441
00:33:48,800 --> 00:33:52,800
Are you coming or not?
5, 4, 3, 2, 1!

442
00:33:52,920 --> 00:33:54,400
I'm not going!

443
00:33:54,800 --> 00:33:59,800
Forget it. You can't force that guy.
The two of us will go instead

444
00:33:59,800 --> 00:34:03,600
I'm sure we'll find the furnace.
Wait here for our good news

445
00:34:21,400 --> 00:34:23,200
Eastern Sea?

446
00:34:23,200 --> 00:34:27,200
Yes! I've decided to look for
the pill furnace with Miss Ma

447
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:32,800
My precious, you've never stepped
foot on the street in the east

448
00:34:32,800 --> 00:34:35,800
And you'll be going to Eastern Sea?
Now, where is that?

449
00:34:36,400 --> 00:34:41,800
My brother, did I hear you wrongly?

450
00:34:42,200 --> 00:34:46,800
We have no lack of pots, bowls,
ladles and spoons at home

451
00:34:46,800 --> 00:34:49,400
But you're going all the way to
Eastern Sea to find some furnace?

452
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:52,800
Really! You...

453
00:34:53,200 --> 00:34:56,800
You're something

454
00:34:56,800 --> 00:35:02,400
Everyone would rather stay indoors
but you can't wait to roam about

455
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:06,800
don't you bring the plague home!

456
00:35:06,800 --> 00:35:13,800
That's right! Our Jiujin is still
suffering in the quarantine camp

457
00:35:14,200 --> 00:35:17,800
Even if you feel bored,

458
00:35:17,800 --> 00:35:24,200
you should be thinking of ways
to save our Jiujin

459
00:35:24,200 --> 00:35:26,800
Don't make us worry about you

460
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:29,200
Sis, will you hear me out?

461
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:35,800
Miss Ma says the pill furnace is made
with the best metals from nine lands

462
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:42,200
Pills made in that furnace will cure
all diseases and prolong one's life

463
00:35:42,200 --> 00:35:46,800
If I bring the pill furnace back,
not only will it save Jiujin's life,

464
00:35:46,800 --> 00:35:50,200
all the people in Ping'an Town
will be saved too!

465
00:35:51,800 --> 00:35:53,800
-Is that true?
-Yes

466
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:57,400
-I don't believe you
-Neither do I

467
00:35:57,600 --> 00:36:00,600
-Are you trying to humour us?
-Exactly

468
00:36:02,800 --> 00:36:09,400
Brother, is this some lousy excuse
for you to elope with Miss Ma?

469
00:36:12,200 --> 00:36:14,200
How can I get through to you?

470
00:36:14,400 --> 00:36:18,200
I don't care
if it's some pot or furnace

471
00:36:18,200 --> 00:36:23,800
You're staying put. You're too weak
to travel all the way to Eastern Sea

472
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:27,800
Be a dear and stay at home.
I'll make good food for you

473
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:31,400
No! I won't obey Mother this time

474
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:36,400
The people in Ping'an Town are
counting on this pill to save them

475
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:40,000
Since I know about its existence,
I should bring it back

476
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:41,600
How can I stand by and do nothing?

477
00:36:42,800 --> 00:36:46,200
But you're not the man
to save the people's lives

478
00:36:46,200 --> 00:36:50,200
Miss Ma is highly skilled.
No terrain will be too tough for her

479
00:36:50,200 --> 00:36:53,400
You'll only be a burden
if you join her

480
00:36:54,200 --> 00:36:58,800
Mother, Miss Ma is a girl. But she's
not worried about the hardship

481
00:36:58,800 --> 00:37:01,800
What's more, I'm a man.
All the more I should go

482
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:03,800
We can look out for each other

483
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:09,400
Brother, she's a girl but
she's a swordswoman!

484
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:12,800
In just one blink,
she's off to another place

485
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:17,800
But can you do it? You'll be trudging
behind with your chest of medicine

486
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:21,800
-You'll only be a burden
-Enough, sis

487
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:23,400
Stop being a wet blanket

488
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:30,800
Mother, I don't deny I've wasted
my 20-odd years in life,

489
00:37:30,800 --> 00:37:33,200
with nothing to show for it

490
00:37:33,400 --> 00:37:35,800
Ever since Jiujin fell ill,

491
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:39,800
I've come to appreciate life and
the importance of family

492
00:37:40,200 --> 00:37:46,800
I hope to do something for everyone
and the people of Ping'an Town

493
00:37:48,200 --> 00:37:52,600
If the so-called amazing
pill furnace really exists,

494
00:37:52,600 --> 00:37:56,400
it may not be a bad idea for Shou
to make the trip

495
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:58,800
-Of course, Mother!
-All right

496
00:37:58,800 --> 00:38:03,800
Mother, let him go.
Jiujin is my only child

497
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:07,800
I'll seem heartless
if I refuse to let him go

498
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:11,200
Sis, rest assured
I'll be able to save Jiujin

499
00:38:12,200 --> 00:38:15,800
But life has its twists and turns

500
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:18,400
Before you leave,

501
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:22,200
let's put pen to paper the
distribution of property and all

502
00:38:23,200 --> 00:38:27,000
-Is he your husband?
-I'll teach him a lesson!

503
00:38:28,200 --> 00:38:31,800
What he'd just said
is making me worried again

504
00:38:32,200 --> 00:38:33,800
Don't worry, Mother

505
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:37,600
I've become stronger after
picking up Five Animal Boxing

506
00:38:37,600 --> 00:38:39,800
Don't worry about me

507
00:38:39,800 --> 00:38:44,200
What's more, Miss Ma will be with me.
I'll be fine

508
00:38:44,800 --> 00:38:48,800
I'll certainly bring back
the pill-cultivating furnace

509
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:52,200
Shou, this is your first trip
away from home

510
00:38:52,200 --> 00:38:55,800
-Remember to put on more clothing
-I will, Mother

511
00:38:56,000 --> 00:39:00,000
You won't enjoy
the convenience of home

512
00:39:00,200 --> 00:39:03,200
Make sure you've got
everything packed

513
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:04,400
I know

514
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:09,800
The bag contains tonics. I've also
packed ginseng slices for you

515
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:15,400
If you feel out of breath,
put one slice in your mouth

516
00:39:15,400 --> 00:39:16,800
-Understand?
-Yes

517
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:26,800
This ointment for all purposes
is good for abrasions and sprains

518
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:31,200
You may snack on some preserved fruit
on the journey

519
00:39:32,200 --> 00:39:35,800
I've prepared another packet
for Miss Ma

520
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:43,800
I've got the kitchen to roast
this fat chicken for you

521
00:39:44,000 --> 00:39:48,400
I've also packed a few steamed buns.
Do remember to eat them

522
00:39:48,600 --> 00:39:50,800
Don't starve yourself

523
00:39:51,400 --> 00:39:52,800
Shou...

524
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:58,200
-Mother...
-Shou...

525
00:40:06,600 --> 00:40:09,200
Be careful on the road

526
00:40:09,600 --> 00:40:12,200
Don't try to compete with others

527
00:40:12,600 --> 00:40:17,200
Let Miss Ma do the heavy chores
and dangerous tasks

528
00:40:17,200 --> 00:40:22,600
She knows kungfu after all. Don't try
to play the hero, understand?

529
00:40:24,000 --> 00:40:25,000
Yes

530
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:30,800
You can't possibly carry all the bags

531
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:37,200
Let's get a cart to carry them.
Tianding and Facai will join you

532
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:40,200
No need, Mother.
I can manage

533
00:40:40,600 --> 00:40:43,800
But I'll be looking for
the pill furnace

534
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:47,400
I'm not moving house.
But you've piled things on me

535
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:50,800
You've never left me all this time

536
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:55,200
But you'll be going to a faraway
place. How can I not worry?

537
00:40:56,400 --> 00:41:01,000
Mother, rest assured
I'll take good care of myself

538
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:06,800
I'm worried because you've never
taken good care of yourself

539
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:11,800
There will always be a first time
to everything, Mother

540
00:41:12,200 --> 00:41:17,800
All right. You've always been
a stubborn child

541
00:41:18,200 --> 00:41:23,000
Once your mind is made up,
no one can change it

542
00:41:25,200 --> 00:41:28,000
You must bear my words in mind

543
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:31,200
Don't push yourself too hard

544
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:35,800
If you find the going tough,
do come home

545
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:38,400
I will, Mother

546
00:41:46,600 --> 00:41:48,200
Shou....

547
00:41:59,200 --> 00:42:04,400
Mother, it's getting late.
I should be going

548
00:42:13,400 --> 00:42:17,400
Shou! Come home soon

549
00:42:19,200 --> 00:42:25,400
I will.
Mother, this chicken weighs a ton

550
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:28,800
Did you roast a huge one?

551
00:42:36,800 --> 00:42:39,800
-Shou, come home soon!
-I will

552
00:42:47,600 --> 00:42:50,400
You're leaving with
so many bags on you!

553
00:42:50,600 --> 00:42:53,400
I couldn't possibly say no to Mother
who packed them for me

554
00:42:58,200 --> 00:43:02,000
Don't you make me carry them
when you get tired!

555
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:04,200
-Don't even think about it!
-Don't despise me

556
00:43:04,200 --> 00:43:07,200
I did beat Lord Iron-arm after all

557
00:43:07,200 --> 00:43:11,200
You'd better think of a way
to get us out of the city

558
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:14,200
I have the gold medal.
Who'd dare stop me?

559
00:43:18,200 --> 00:43:20,200
Lord Iron-arm,
what are you doing here?

560
00:43:20,200 --> 00:43:22,200
The paths of enemies always cross

561
00:43:22,200 --> 00:43:26,200
Thanks to you, Lord Yonghuan
has made me guard the city gate

562
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:31,600
So mean of him to punish you
this way. I'm sorry about it

563
00:43:31,600 --> 00:43:35,400
The cheek of you to mention that
embarrassing incident of yours

564
00:43:35,400 --> 00:43:38,200
We're leaving the city.
Get out of our way

565
00:43:38,200 --> 00:43:39,400
No!

566
00:43:41,400 --> 00:43:43,400
-What's that?
-A hand

567
00:43:43,400 --> 00:43:45,800
See what I'm holding in my hand!

568
00:43:46,200 --> 00:43:50,200
Constable Ma, since you're so free,
use it to swat flies

569
00:43:51,200 --> 00:43:54,800
Lord Yonghuan has banned everyone
from leaving the city

570
00:43:55,200 --> 00:43:57,200
Look behind you

571
00:44:04,200 --> 00:44:05,200
Subtitled by A Han


